      "message": "fix(contour): ride the pass link plane between rings; pin the traverse\n\nA ring entered by a ramp or helix crossed to the next ring at the level\nlink's plane. It now crosses at the pass link's plane (clearance for pass\nClearance, the hop plane otherwise, also for a keep-down link that failed\nits proof). The crossing rapid stays and is pinned: without it the Auto\nramp certifies its chord from the end of the earlier ring and dives on\nevery ring. Move the ring-entry choice into contour_link.rs and keep\ncontour.rs under 400 lines.\n\nRefs #3830\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
